  str_skill_href_desc_name_30100 = "Color Board",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30100 = [[
Zeta can fill her Color Board up with colors as follows. Once it is filled, she'll be able to cast her Secret Razzle Dazzle Active Skill.
1. Her Variety Blitz Active Skill records the colors of selected tiles before resetting them.
2. When moving to attack a target, Conan, summoned by the Secret Razzle Dazzle Active Skill, will record the colors of the tiles he traverses.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30110 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30110 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
The block will change at random each time Batia uses her Active Skill.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30111 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30111 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
The block will change at random each time Batia uses her Active Skill.
Each Red tile traversed grants it 1 Energy. Consume 5 Energy to randomize the block. Each randomizing attempt will cost an additional 5 Energy until the next use of her Active Skill.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30112 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30112 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
The block will change at random each time Batia uses her Active Skill.
Next Queue starts with 10 Energy, and each Red tile traversed grants it 1 Energy. Consume 5 Energy to randomize the block. Each randomizing attempt will cost an additional 5 Energy until the next use of her Active Skill.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30113 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30113 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
The block will change at random each time Batia uses her Active Skill.
Next Queue starts with 10 Energy, and each Red tile traversed grants it 1 Energy. Consume 5 Energy to randomize the block.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30114 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30114 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
The block will change at random each time Batia uses her Active Skill.
Each Red tile traversed grants it 1 Energy. Consume 5 Energy to randomize the block. Each randomizing attempt will cost an additional 5 Energy until the next use of her Active Skill.
Lock the block in Next Queue to prevent it from randomizing. While locked, each randomization enhances the current block instead. For each enhancement, the Active Skill will also generate a Dark Tile at a random location.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30115 = "Next Queue",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30115 = [[
Next Queue displays one of seven types of blocks that represent the range of tiles that Batia's Active Skill can convert.
Whenever Batia releases her Active Skill, a block will appear randomly.
Next Queue starts with 10 Energy, and each Red tile traversed grants it 1 Energy. Consume 5 Energy to randomize the block. Each randomizing attempt will cost an additional 5 Energy until the next use of her Active Skill.
Lock the block in Next Queue to prevent it from randomizing. While locked, each randomization enhances the current block instead. For each enhancement, the Active Skill will also generate a Dark Tile at a random location.]],
