  str_skill_href_desc_name_30117 = "Requiem Mark",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30117 = "Gains 1 stack each time a Chain Combo or Normal Attack triggers a lightning strike on an enemy.",
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30118 = "Lord's Covenant",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30118 = "Only one target on the field can have the Lord's Covenant at a time.",
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30119 = "AP",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30119 = "Collaboration characters from Atelier Ryza 2 share AP. Each character can use an Active Skill once per round. They gain 10 AP at the end of a round if no Active Skill is used.",
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30120 = "AP",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30120 = "Collaboration characters from Atelier Ryza 2 share AP. Each character can use an Active Skill once per round. They gain 20 AP upon entering battle and 10 AP at the end of a round if no Active Skill is used.",
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30121 = "AP",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30121 = "Collaboration characters from Atelier Ryza 2 share AP. Each character can use an Active Skill once per round. They gain 20 AP upon entering battle and 10 AP at the end of each round.",
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30122 = "Tactics System",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30122 = [[
Obtain Tactical Points through various in-battle actions and trigger corresponding effects when reaching certain amounts.
10 TP - Lv. 1: Increases the final damage of Atelier Ryza 2 collab characters' Chain Combo by 15%.
40 TP - Lv. 2: Generates 1 Dark Tile at a random location at the start of each round.
70 TP - Lv. 3: Ryza and Patricia's Chain Combos inflict 1 stack of Burn upon hit. Klaudia's Chain Combo inflicts 1 stack of Poison upon hit.
100 TP - Lv. 4: Increases the final damage of Atelier Ryza 2 collab characters' Active Skill by 50%.
130 TP - Lv. 5: Generates 1 extra Dark Tile at a random location at the start of each round.]],
  str_skill_href_desc_name_30123 = "Tactics System",
  str_skill_href_desc_desc_30123 = [[
Obtain Tactical Points through various in-battle actions and trigger corresponding effects when reaching certain amounts. The default level cap is 5, which increases by 1 upon entering battle.
10 TP - Lv. 1: Increases the final damage of Atelier Ryza 2 collab characters' Chain Combo by 15%.
40 TP - Lv. 2: Generates 1 Dark Tile at a random location at the start of each round.
70 TP - Lv. 3: Ryza and Patricia's Chain Combos inflict 1 stack of Burn upon hit. Klaudia's Chain Combo inflicts 1 stack of Poison upon hit.
100 TP - Lv. 4: Increases the final damage of Atelier Ryza 2 collab characters' Active Skill by 50%.
130 TP - Lv. 5: Generates 1 extra Dark Tile at a random location at the start of each round.
160 TP - Lv. 6: Increases the Basic ATK of Atelier Ryza 2 collab characters by 10%.
200 TP - Lv. 7: Generates 1 extra Dark Tile at a random location at the start of each round.]],
