<color=#00F6FF>Lone State</color>: Deals <color=#00F6FF>210%</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>2 surrounding clusters</color>.]],
  str_skill_desc_20015510 = "Deals <color=#00F6FF>{1}%</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>12 tiles in a diamond shape</color>.",
  str_skill_desc_20015520 = "Deals <color=#00F6FF>{1}%</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>16 tiles in a radial shape</color>.",
  str_skill_desc_20015530 = "Deals <color=#00F6FF>{1}%</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>2 surrounding clusters</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_410155 = "While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state, </color> normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_416155 = "While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state, </color> normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_420155 = "While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, the first normal attack on each enemy every round will be followed up with an additional normal attack, dealing <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_426155 = "While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, the first normal attack on each enemy every round will be followed up with an additional normal attack, dealing <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_430155 = "Normal attacks can <color=#00F6FF>target enemies on a diagonal tile</color>. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state, </color> normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, the first normal attack on each enemy every round will be followed up with an additional normal attack, dealing <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_436155 = "Normal attacks can <color=#00F6FF>target enemies on a diagonal tile</color>. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state, </color> normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> of normal damage. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, the first normal attack on each enemy every round will be followed up with an additional normal attack, dealing <color=#00F6FF>{1}</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>.",
  str_skill_upgrade_desc_16015513 = "Active Skill Enhancement: Gains <color=#00F6FF>20</color> Lone Energy at the beginning of each battle.",
  str_skill_upgrade_desc_16015516 = "Active Skill Enhancement: Immediately gains <color=#00F6FF>5</color> Lone Energy after using Active Skill.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_440153 = "Normal attacks can <color=#00F6FF>target enemies on a diagonal tile</color>. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state, </color> normal attacks deal damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>. Non-target tiles receive <color=#00F6FF>65%</color> of normal damage. While in <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color>, the first normal attack on each enemy every round will be followed up with an additional normal attack, dealing <color=#00F6FF>65%</color> damage to <color=#00F6FF>1 surrounding cluster</color>.",
  str_skill_desc_350155 = "Consumes 20 <link=\"30045\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_desc_353155 = "Consumes 20 <link=\"30046\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_desc_356155 = "Consumes 20 <link=\"30047\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_desc_360155 = "Consumes 16 <link=\"30045\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_desc_363155 = "Consumes 16 <link=\"30046\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_desc_366155 = "Consumes 16 <link=\"30047\"><#FFAE07><u>Lone Energy</u></color></link> to enter <color=#00F6FF>Lone state</color> in the current round, increasing Chain Combo range and damage. At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state</color> in the next round.",
  str_skill_upgrade_refine_desc_16015511 = "Equipment Skill Enhancement: While in Lone state, normal attacks deal <color=#00F6FF>65%</color> of normal damage to non-target tiles.",
  str_skill_upgrade_refine_desc_16015512 = "Active Skill Enhancement: At the end of the round, if the remaining Lone Energy at the end of the round is no less than <color=#00F6FF>8</color>, Lone Energy will be <color=#00F6FF>halved</color> (reducing at least 8 points) and <color=#00F6FF>retain Lone state in the next round</color>.",
  str_skill_upgrade_refine_desc_16015513 = "Active Skill Enhancement: Consumes <color=#00F6FF>16</color> Lone Energy to enter Lone state.",
  str_skill_upgrade_desc_16015313 = [[
Active Skill Enhancement: Changes Active Skill to <color=#FFFF00>Preemptive Strike</color>. Available upon entering combat.
