  str_skill_name_29041011 = "Bind",
  str_skill_desc_29041011 = [[
Yoh conjures a powerful illusion and pulls Aurorians into it.
During this period, he summons several projectiles with a fixed trajectory to fly across the field and deal heavy damage to Aurorians upon hitting them.
The team can move 5 times at will. Each move is limited to 1 tile.]],
  str_skill_name_29041012 = "Control",
  str_skill_desc_29041012 = [[
When there are projectiles on the field, Yoh controls them, directing them toward Aurorians to deal damage.
When there are no projectiles on the field, Yoh will divide and hide. Upon taking damage, you'll know which of the replicas is actually him.]],
  str_skill_name_29041013 = "Reality Void",
  str_skill_desc_29041013 = [[
When there are projectiles on the field, Yoh controls them, directing them toward Aurorians to deal damage.
When there are no projectiles on the field, Yoh will divide and hide. Upon taking damage, you'll know which of the replicas is actually him.]],
  str_skill_name_29041014 = "Speech",
