  str_skill_desc_3001811 = "Summons <color=#00F6FF>1</color> Ancestral Flame and converts the selected tile into a Red tile. The Ancestral Flame can be summoned to a tile an enemy is standing on and will move along with the target. <color=#00F6FF>Before moving and connecting tiles</color>, all tiles along the path the Ancestral Flame travels will be <color=#00F6FF>converted into Red tiles</color>. Ancestral Flames on enemies will disappear <color=#00F6FF>when the Aurorians start to move along the connected tiles</color>.",
