  str_skill_passive_desc_4432301 = "At the start of each round or when passing over a Dark Tile, deals DEF-ignoring damage once equal to <color=#00F6FF>35%</color> of the team's lost HP to enemies with the Lord's Covenant. Victoria: Elegy restores <color=#00F6FF>3%</color> of lost Sanity whenever she damages such an enemy (at least 1 point). Whenever Sanity changes from 50 or above to below 50, or from below 50 to 50 or above, the nearest non-Red tile to the team is converted into a <color=#00F6FF>Red Dark Tile</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_4442301 = "At the start of each round or when passing over a Dark Tile, deals DEF-ignoring damage once equal to <color=#00F6FF>35%</color> of the team's lost HP to enemies with the Lord's Covenant. Victoria: Elegy restores <color=#00F6FF>3%</color> of lost Sanity whenever she damages such an enemy (at least 1 point). Whenever Sanity changes from 50 or above to below 50, or from below 50 to 50 or above, the nearest non-Red tile to the team is converted into a <color=#00F6FF>Red Dark Tile</color>.",
  str_skill_passive_desc_4462301 = "At the start of each round or when passing over a Dark Tile, deals DEF-ignoring damage once equal to <color=#00F6FF>35%</color> of the team's lost HP to enemies with the Lord's Covenant. Victoria: Elegy restores <color=#00F6FF>3%</color> of lost Sanity whenever she damages such an enemy (at least 1 point). Whenever Sanity changes from 50 or above to below 50, or from below 50 to 50 or above, the nearest non-Red tile to the team is converted into a <color=#00F6FF>Red Dark Tile</color>. Victoria: Elegy's damage to enemies with the Lord's Covenant increases as team HP decreases, maxing at <color=#00F6FF>15%</color> when team HP is at 50%.",
